<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>@ViewBag.Title - My Movie List</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            padding-top: 70px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
        }

        /* 모달 이쁘게 */
        .modal-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0;
        }

        .modal-title {
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .close-btn {
            color: white;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .modal-body p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #e50914;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- 네비게이션 바 -->
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark fixed-top">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Movies")">My Movie List</a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Home")">Home</a></li>

                    <!-- About을 모달로 띄우기 -->
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#aboutModal">About</a>
                    </li>

                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="@Url.Action("Contact", "Home")">Contact</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link btn btn-danger text-white px-4 ms-3" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Movies")">
                            내 영화 컬렉션
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container body-content">
        @RenderBody()
        <hr />
        <footer>
            <p>© @DateTime.Now.Year - My Movie List by <strong>김상우</strong></p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <!-- About 모달 팝업 -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="aboutModal" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content overflow-hidden rounded-3">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h2 class="modal-title">
                        About This App
                    </h2>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white close-btn" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body text-center py-5">
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <h1 class="display-1 fw-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600">
                            김상우
                        </h1>
                        <p class="lead">개발자 & 영화</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row g-4 text-start mt-4">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <p><strong>연락처:</strong> <span class="highlight">010-6259-2887</span></p>
                            <p><strong>제작 용도:</strong> ASP.NET MVC 학습 프로젝트</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <p><strong>제작일:</strong> @DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyy년 MM월 dd일")</p>
                            <p><strong>프레임워크:</strong> ASP.NET MVC + Entity Framework</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-5">
                        <p class="text-muted fs-5">
                            "내가 가진 영화를 한눈에 보고 싶다"는<br>
                            단순한 생각에서 시작한 작은 프로젝트.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-success fw-bold fs-4">완성했습니다!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer justify-content-center bg-light">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-lg px-5" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                        닫기
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>